&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Manage a portfolio of Luxe hosts, serving as their primary point of contact and trusted advisor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
